# Applied to every Maven invocation in this project, local and CI alike.
#
# CI has repeatedly failed on transient upstream HTTP errors that have nothing to do with the
# build, e.g. Maven Central returning 502 mid-resolve:
#   Could not transfer artifact org.apache.maven.shared:file-management:jar:3.1.0 from/to central
#   (https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2): status code: 502, reason phrase: Bad Gateway (502)
# Without a retry handler a single blip fails an entire job, and the error reads like a broken
# dependency rather than a bad minute on someone else's server.
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.count=3
-Dmaven.wagon.httpconnectionManager.ttlSeconds=120
